        "observationBoundary": {
            "const": "Six RAM-owned streams run through the unmodified ExecuteMapScript loop in one debug Map Test 0 launch. A session-only RunMapSetupInitFunction trampoline replaces its jsr (a0) plus movem span with an absolute JSR, supplies the original A0 script input, discards that patched return, and then executes the source movem.l (sp)+,d0-a1 and rts epilogue in verified 20-byte FF padding. The observer records at the final stub rts after the restored-register epilogue, plus interpreter word reads, the debug P2-START skip-gate branch, Sleep call presence and the one WaitForVInt entry for D0=1, opcode dispatch, the csc05 sound-command trap seam, csc06 return, csc0A target/cursor/stack return boundary, csc0B cursor replacement, and csc_end return. It does not characterize larger Sleep durations, audible/Z80/YM/PSG results, persistence, normal-story reachability, or arbitrary callee effects."
